 tlist. If your plans change and you're not coming\, opening up a spot 4-5 
 days before the hike it's more likely someone will be able to attend than 
 if you cancel at the last minute. You're considered a no-show if you cance
 l at the last minute. Members with 2 no-shows are removed from the group.
